      "id": "claim_b823ac1ae2804800ae8f17a8a5d42f91",
      "statement": "agent/server.py:get_agent assembles the main coding agent's static_tools list covering web access (http_request, fetch_url, web_search), plan lifecycle (save_plan), background execution (background_execute, background_task), user instructions and skills (save_user_instructions, save_user_skill, delete_user_skill), optional user-settings mutation (save_user_settings), thread operations (list_threads, get_thread, manage_thread, start_thread), human reviewer operations (request_human_review, assign_human_reviewer, auto_assign_human_reviewer, dismiss_human_review_request), notifications (notify_automation_channel, submit_thread_feedback, submit_review_assessment_feedback), baby-sit management (manage_baby_sit), PR creation (open_pull_request, link_pull_request), PR review operations (expedite_pr_approval, merge_expedited_pr, request_pr_review), sandbox recovery (recreate_sandbox), scheduling (schedule_thread_wakeup), user-settings lookup (read_user_settings), platform-issue reporting (report_platform_issue), Slack tools, incident management (manage_incident), code-channel management (manage_code_channel), and optional Notion comments, SQL, CLI results, and review policy; signed sandbox download tools are included only when enabled.",
